ointList.get(i).get(k));\n                    }\n                    row.add(vec);\n                }\n                vectors.add(row);\n            }\n\n            Set<Integer> excluded = new HashSet<>();\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                boolean found = false;\n                for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) {\n                    for (int k = 0; k < n; k++) {\n                        if (!vectors.get(i).get(j).equals(vectors.get(i).get(k)) && dot(vectors.get(i).get(j), vectors.get(i).get(k))) {\n                            excluded.add(i + 1);\n                            found = true;\n                            break;\n                        }\n                    }\n                    if (found) break;\n                }\n            }\n\n            System.out.println(n - excluded.size());\n            for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n                if (!excluded.contains(i)) {\n                    System.out.println(i);\n                }\n            }\n        } else {\n            System.out.println(0);\n        }\n    }\n\n    private static boolean dot(List<Long> a, List<Long> b) {\n        long sum = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n            sum += a.get(i) * b.get(i);\n        }\n        return sum > 0;\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\n        if (n <= 11) {\n            long[][] points = new long[n][5];\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                for (int j = 0; j < 5; j++) {\n                    points[i][j] = sc.nextLong();\n                }\n            }\n\n            List<List<Long>> pointList = new ArrayList<>();\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                List<Long> p =